OL,3,GNEWSAService increases access to mental
OL,4,Ahealth support
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople struggling with their mental
OL,7,Fhealth and wellbeing are being
OL,8,Fencouraged to access free support ahead
OL,9,Fof World Mental Health Day.
OL,11,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council said
OL,12,Fits Wellbeing for Us programme, aimed
OL,13,Fat residents aged 18 and over, was
OL,14,Fdesigned to help people build
OL,15,Fconfidence and make meaningful social
OL,16,Fconnections, while reducing isolation.
OL,18,FThe programme includes face-to-face
OL,19,Fworkshops and informal peer support
OL,20,Fsocial groups and covers a range of
OL,21,Ftopics, including managing anxiety and
OL,22,Fstress and boosting self-esteem.
